			"notes": "## Fixes\n\n- Fixed the ModernUI rounded tooltip falling back to obscure-tooltips' panel when JOML's `Matrix4fStack` depth field could not be resolved. JOML exposes it as `curr`, not `current`; the renderer now reads `curr` and keeps `current` as a fallback.\n- ModernUI remains optional: when its internals cannot be resolved, the tooltip now keeps obscure-tooltips' panel and frame instead of ending up with no background or border.\n- Restored the previous fog start/end after each tooltip and froze fog colour and shape while tooltip content is buffered, so a stray fog update cannot black out tooltip glyphs.\n- Made the capture-only layer gates inert during normal gameplay. Text and image components are always rendered unless the game is started with `-Dmodernobscure.capture=true`.\n- Obscure Tooltips 4.2.x and Fragmentum 5.x are now declared as required dependencies with explicit version ranges, so a missing or incompatible version fails with a clear loader error instead of a mixin crash."
		},
