			"notes": "## New Features\n\n- Added a smooth tooltip transition: the tooltip now glides toward the cursor instead of snapping to it, and it animates its size when it appears or when its content changes. Movement speed, snap distance and the starting scale can be tuned from the mod config screen (Cloth Config through Mod Menu on Fabric, the built-in screen on NeoForge and Forge).\n\n\n## Fixes\n\n- Fixed the rarity glow ignoring ModernUI's rounded tooltip. obscure-tooltips draws its `rim_light` and `shimmer` effects as hardcoded rectangles, so the glow kept square corners and poked past the rounded border. Both effects are now redrawn along a rounded outline whose radius is read from ModernUI itself, so the glow hugs the panel at any corner-radius setting.\n- Removed the dark hairline between the tooltip border and the glow. The glow band started a fixed 3 px outside the layout box, while ModernUI centres a 1.33 px border stroke on an outline 4 px out, which left a strip of dark panel fill visible between the two. The band now starts exactly at the border's inner edge."
		},
