			"notes": "## Fixes\n\n- **Fixed a game crash** on startup that many users hit after updating Obscure Tooltips and Fragmentum to their latest versions. Updating this mod restores compatibility with Obscure Tooltips 4.2.5 (1.21.1) / 3.10.1 (1.20.1) and Fragmentum 5.0.0.\n- Tooltips render correctly again with the latest Obscure Tooltips and Fragmentum.\n\n\n## Notes\n\n- Fabric builds now require [Fabric Language Kotlin](https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-language-kotlin).\n- This release ships Minecraft 1.20.1 (Fabric, Forge) and 1.21.1 (Fabric, NeoForge). The 1.21.11 build is unchanged and remains on 1.5.1."
		},
